{"ticker":"U","updated":"2026-11-27T23:27:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Unity Software Inc.","shortName":"Unity Software Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://unity.com","fullTimeEmployees":4412,"marketCap":22324584448,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":19.011621,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":10.241165,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":62.482,"targetHighPrice":74.0,"targetLowPrice":49.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.322,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.78488,"operatingMargins":-0.02269,"profitMargins":-0.15595001,"totalRevenue":2179887104,"beta":2.108,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":54.265,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":16.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Unity Software Inc. operates a platform to develop, deploy, and grow games and interactive experiences for mobile phones, PCs, consoles, and extended reality devices in the United States, China, Hong Kong, Taiwan, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, Canada, and Latin America. The company's platform offers artificial intelligence solutions that support developers through the entire development lifecycle, which includes prototyping, live service operation, user acquisition, and monetization. It also provides Create Solutions, a set of tools and services used to build, ship, and run real-time 2D and 3D content; and Grow Solutions, which allows customers to grow and engage their user base and monetize their content. In addition, the company offers enterprise support and consumption services; professional services, including consulting, platform integration, training, and custom application and workflow development services; and advertising and game publishing services. It provides its solutions directly through its online store, field sales operations, independent distributors, and resellers. The company serves enterprises, mid-market companies, government, and non-profit institutions; mid-sized, small, and independent businesses; and individuals from various industries. Unity Software Inc. was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Unity Software Inc. 經營一個平台，為美國、中國、香港、台灣、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區、加拿大和拉丁美洲的手機、個人電腦、遊戲機和擴展現實設備開發、部署和發展遊戲和互動體驗。該公司的平台提供人工智慧解決方案，在整個開發生命週期中為開發人員提供支持，包括原型設計、即時服務營運、用戶獲取和貨幣化。它還提供 Create Solutions，這是一組用於建立、發布和運行即時 2D 和 3D 內容的工具和服務；成長解決方案，讓客戶可以擴大和吸引他們的用戶群，並透過他們的內容貨幣化。此外，該公司還提供企業支援和消費服務；專業服務，包括諮詢、平台整合、培訓以及客製化應用程式和工作流程開發服務；以及廣告和遊戲發行服務。它直接透過其線上商店、現場銷售業務、獨立分銷商和經銷商提供解決方案。該公司服務於企業、中端市場公司、政府和非營利組織；中型、小型和獨立企業；以及來自各個行業的個人。 Unity Software Inc. 成立於 2004 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":43.39,"h":43.52,"l":42.615,"c":42.94,"v":8019900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":42.56,"h":42.94,"l":39.271,"c":40.04,"v":15046600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":40.09,"h":40.72,"l":37.75,"c":38.3,"v":21872500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":38.83,"h":39.2,"l":37.92,"c":39.1,"v":10324800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":39.47,"h":39.72,"l":37.15,"c":37.89,"v":11158900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":38.5,"h":38.75,"l":36.81,"c":37.53,"v":13570400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":36.87,"h":37.18,"l":35.72,"c":36.4,"v":12429300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":36.66,"h":37.08,"l":36.22,"c":36.58,"v":8592600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":36.75,"h":39.04,"l":36.37,"c":38.96,"v":12978000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":39.16,"h":39.99,"l":35.95,"c":36.08,"v":12094400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":37.01,"h":37.33,"l":35.4,"c":37.14,"v":8201700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":36.15,"h":37.13,"l":35.55,"c":36.58,"v":6815000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":37.85,"h":38.59,"l":36.94,"c":37.41,"v":6839000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":36.425,"h":36.74,"l":34.22,"c":34.72,"v":13005200},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":34.04,"h":35.38,"l":34.04,"c":35.24,"v":7964600},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":35.42,"h":35.9,"l":34.842,"c":35.27,"v":5163700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":35.35,"h":38.43,"l":35.19,"c":36.29,"v":11985000},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":36.52,"h":36.52,"l":34.383,"c":35.25,"v":77